<title>KAZAKHSTAN: TABLE-Kazakhstan sells 600 mln tenge bills Aug 4.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Kazakhstan sells 600 mln tenge bills Aug 4.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kazakhstan will auction 600 million tenge ($7.9 million) of six-month MKM discount Treasury bills on August 4, the National Bank said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Full details of the six-month issue:</p>
<p>    Series number		  KZ46K0502984</p>
<p>    Issue volume		   600 million tenge</p>
<p>    Denominations		  100 tenge</p>
<p>    Tenor			    182 days</p>
<p>    Issue date		     Aug 4</p>
<p>    Maturity date		  Feb 5, 1998</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410 ($ = 75.8 Kazakhstan Tenge)</p>
</text>
